[I] Powerful curses-based MUD client

[T] TinyFugue is a flexible, screen-oriented MUD client for connecting to
[T] text based online games. It has a powerful macro language with triggers
[T] and hooks; this rebirth version adds Python and Lua scripting and wide
[T] character support.

[U] https://github.com/ingwarsw/tinyfugue

